        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samantha Cristoforetti, Jean-Loup Chrétien\n- Organizations: European Space Agency, Italian Air Force, CNES, French Air Force\n- Products: ISSpresso\n- Topics: astronauts, military aviation, space coffee\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Loup Chrétien was born on 20 August 1938.\n- Samantha Cristoforetti was born on 26 April 1977 in Milan.\n- Jean-Loup Chrétien is a French retired brigadier general in the French Air Force and a former CNES spationaut.\n- Samantha Cristoforetti is an Italian European Space Agency astronaut, Italian Air Force pilot, and engineer.\n- On 3 May 2015, astronaut Samantha Cristoforetti drank the first espresso coffee in space using ISSpresso.",
